.TH parsec-cli-workspace 1  "workspace " 
.SH NAME
parsec\-cli\-workspace \- Contains subcommands related to workspace
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBparsec\-cli workspace\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Contains subcommands related to workspace
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
parsec\-cli\-workspace\-list\-users(1)
List workspace users and their roles
.TP
parsec\-cli\-workspace\-archive(1)
Archive workspace
.TP
parsec\-cli\-workspace\-create(1)
Create new workspace
.TP
parsec\-cli\-workspace\-list(1)
List workspaces
.TP
parsec\-cli\-workspace\-import(1)
Import a local file to a remote workspace
.TP
parsec\-cli\-workspace\-share(1)
Share workspace
.TP
parsec\-cli\-workspace\-sync(1)
Sync workspace data with the server
.TP
parsec\-cli\-workspace\-mount(1)
Mount a workspace on the filesystem
.TP
parsec\-cli\-workspace\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
